# Files the routers write next to their configuration, once this folder
# has been copied out and git-inited as a lab of its own. The lab's git
# history replaces their backups and rollbacks.
*.sav
*.tmp
*.broken
*.kernel
*.rollback.*
# routescope runtime state: recordings and scenario reports, and what
# nodes write in their run folders. A run folder keeps its .gitkeep,
# because a bind-mounted folder must exist. notes.jsonl is not listed:
# routescope keeps the notes in the lab so the lab's git can keep them.
recordings/
*-run/*
!*-run/.gitkeep
# what containerlab writes when it deploys the lab, and its backup of
# the topology file
clab-*/
.*.clab.yml.bak
.*.bak
